en:
''This is Station to Observer coordinates received, friendly Goshawk is inbound for a rocket run.''

^orange;Hydra 70 Rocket Strafe:^reset; Fires a ^yellow;non-damaging beacon^reset; that ^orange;calls upon a Goshawk Fightercraft with Hydra 70 Rocket Pods to strafe the target zone.^reset; Strafing begins from left-to-right.
^yellow;Requires decent space, but can work underground | Reloads using Cracked Red Suns.^reset;
^orange;Tap Right-Click to Fire/Reload the Coordinator.^reset;

ko:
''여기는 스테이션, 옵저버. 좌표 수신. 아군 고스호크가 로켓 기습으로 진입 중.''

^orange;히드라 70 로켓 기습:^reset; ^yellow;피해 없는 비컨^reset;을 발사해 ^orange;히드라 70 로켓 포드를 단 고스호크 전투기를 불러 표적 구역을 기습하게 한다.^reset; 기습은 왼쪽에서 오른쪽으로 시작된다.
^yellow;충분한 공간이 필요하지만 지하에서도 사용 가능 | 깨진 붉은 태양으로 재장전.^reset;
^orange;우클릭을 눌러 조정장치 발사/재장전.^reset;

en:
''I don't care or give a shit if it's a magical pony flying through the sky, JUST SHOOT IT DOWN!'' 
ZSU-23-4 Shilka Turret Close in Weapons System (starship point defense replica production model): Fires a ^yellow;non-damaging beacon^reset; that ^orange;directs your ship to fire a short barrage of high explosive 23mm shells at the impact site of the beacon.^reset;
^yellow;Requires decent space, but can work underground via use of teleporter munitions | Reloads using Healing Flasks.^reset;
^orange;Tap Right-Click to Fire/Reload the Coordinator.^reset;

ko:
