en:
The PK-120 (GRAU index 1P87) is a sight that was part of the Russian Ratnik program in order to bring the Russian Armed Forces into the modern age. The PK-120 is intended to be the Russian answer to the American made EOTech sight after observing a noticeable improvement to overall combat effectiveness in units equipped with such a optic when compared those that are not equipped with any optics.
^orange;+10% Weapon Proficiency.^reset; 
^green;Right-click on a compatible GiC Weapon to attach.^reset;

