The PK-AS is an advanced reflex sight manufactured by BelOMO (Belarusian Optical & Mechanical Association). It is a unique advanced scope as it is powered, but if the battery dies, the red dot becomes a black dot, allowing the wielder to still know where they are aiming if their sight loses power. It is used quite frequently by the Russian army. 
